<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa should speed up fx reform - analyst.</title>
<headline>S.Africa should speed up fx reform - analyst.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa should quickly consolidate gains made from recent economic reforms and abolish exchange controls as quickly as possible, Rob Lee of the financial services group Board of Executors said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In his latest Investment Outlook, economic adviser Lee said there was &quot;increasing evidence that the government has taken to heart the message from financial markets that economic reforms need to be implemented with much greater urgency.&quot;</p>
</text>
